<title>UK: Essen Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank,</p>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    05.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.625    PAY DATE    05.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.125     LISTING   DUSSELDORF PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.03	SELL CONC  0.095     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
